' ============================================================================
'  descend.cut -- one short beat each time you go a level deeper.
'
'  ONE scene handles all nine descents rather than nine files. The depth is
'  read from game state, so the branch lives in the script where an author can
'  see it, and adding a line for level 7 does not mean touching any code.
'
'  This is the most-seen cut-scene in a run, so it is deliberately SHORT --
'  about four seconds if you let it play, less if you press a key. A beat you
'  watch nine times a game earns its length differently from an ending.
' ============================================================================

scene descend
storybook "Going Deeper" "One short beat, nine times a run."

' No `stage` line: the default stage is exactly the screen, which is what a
' short beat with one slow push-in wants.

show bg "bg/cut-stair.png" fill at 0.5,0.5
cam 0.5,0.35 zoom 1.05

' Everything below runs UNDER this push-in, which lasts the whole scene.
async zoom to 1.35 over 5.0 ease inoutcubic
async pan  to 0.5,0.62 over 5.0 ease inoutcubic

sfx "stairs"
caption "DESCENDING" at 66,3 anchor c color bone fade 0.6

' ------------------------------------------------------------- where you are
if level >= 9
    caption "LEVEL NINE" at 66,5 anchor c color red fade 0.6
    say "There is no tenth level. Whatever is down here knows that too."
elseif level >= 7
    caption "THE DEEP LEVELS" at 66,5 anchor c color orange fade 0.6
    say "The stone stops being cut and starts being worn."
elseif level >= 5
    caption "THE CRYPT LEVELS" at 66,5 anchor c color gold fade 0.6
    say "Down here the doors were built to be closed from the outside."
else
    say "The stair turns, and turns, and does not end."
end

' -------------------------------------------------- what you are carrying
' A second, independent branch. Two small conditionals read better than one
' big one, and each can be edited without disturbing the other.
if has_key
    say "The Level Key is warm in your hand. It should not be warm."
elseif gold >= 5000
    say "Your purse has started to make you slower, and louder."
end

waitall
fade to black over 0.5
